{"segment_id": "segment_00010", "start": 300.0, "end": 330.0, "speech": "练习的是流利性，而不是准确性，对吧？不能太差啊，流利性一定要好。看着这些，您自己说一遍就可以了。第一个单元我都有重复过啊，有都有示范过。拿不准的，您回第一个单元再看一下。Summary writing, journal写作，您写完了之后来这里对一下答案就好了啊，不多说。然后topic for discussion呢，是完全自由的对话。这是我们所有练习、单词、造句、文章跟", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000031.webp", "time": 306.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Tell the story", "① 'call that a hat' -to my wife", "'needn't -so rude'-answered", "sat -modern chair -holes -waited", "④ half an hour -wife -still -mirror", "'mustn't buy -don't need'-remarked", "5", "'needn't -said that'-answered", "'remind -terrible tie -yesterday'", "⑧ 'a man -never -too many'-I said", "⑨ 'a woman -many hats'-answered", "⑩ out -shop -wife -hat -lighthouse"], "scores": [0.97756, 0.94982, 0.97441, 0.96639, 0.94525, 0.9785, 0.99916, 0.99281, 0.95889, 0.96609, 0.96741, 0.96304], "boxes": [[[94.0, 131.0], [404.0, 142.0], [402.0, 202.0], [92.0, 192.0]], [[143.0, 273.0], [826.0, 277.0], [826.0, 347.0], [143.0, 342.0]], [[224.0, 354.0], [893.0, 354.0], [893.0, 413.0], [224.0, 413.0]], [[223.0, 430.0], [974.0, 429.0], [974.0, 488.0], [223.0, 489.0]], [[148.0, 501.0], [913.0, 505.0], [913.0, 565.0], [148.0, 561.0]], [[226.0, 578.0], [1059.0, 576.0], [1059.0, 638.0], [226.0, 640.0]], [[164.0, 593.0], [193.0, 593.0], [193.0, 619.0], [164.0, 619.0]], [[223.0, 651.0], [914.0, 653.0], [914.0, 713.0], [223.0, 711.0]], [[222.0, 725.0], [934.0, 731.0], [934.0, 796.0], [222.0, 791.0]], [[143.0, 800.0], [950.0, 803.0], [950.0, 869.0], [143.0, 866.0]], [[144.0, 873.0], [969.0, 877.0], [969.0, 946.0], [144.0, 943.0]], [[143.0, 948.0], [955.0, 953.0], [955.0, 1022.0], [143.0, 1016.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000032.webp", "time": 315.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "训练目标：", "写作复述能力"], "scores": [0.99627, 0.95888, 0.99967], "boxes": [[[53.0, 130.0], [569.0, 137.0], [568.0, 204.0], [52.0, 196.0]], [[107.0, 333.0], [341.0, 333.0], [341.0, 394.0], [107.0, 394.0]], [[109.0, 398.0], [414.0, 398.0], [414.0, 459.0], [109.0